### Registro de primer usuario Admin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "full_name": "Admin CoWorkFlow",
    "email": "admin@test.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Registro de primer usuario normal
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "full_name": "User CoWorkFlow",
    "email": "user@test.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "client"
}

### Intento de Login con usuario admin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Intento de Login con usuario normal
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

